      <data key="d1">Protein-ribulosamine 3-kinase, chloroplastic</data>
      <data key="d2">Initiates a process leading to the deglycation of proteins (PubMed:15705060). Phosphorylates low-molecular-mass and protein-bound erythrulosamines and ribulosamines, but not fructosamines or psicosamines, on the third carbon of the sugar moiety (PubMed:15705060). Protein-bound erythrulosamine 3-phosphates and ribulosamine 3-phosphates are unstable and decompose under physiological conditions (PubMed:15705060)</data>
