    <node id="protein:Q7TQF2">
      <data key="d0">PROTEIN</data>
      <data key="d1">F-box only protein 10</data>
      <data key="d2">Substrate-recognition component of the SCF (SKP1-CUL1-F-box protein)-type E3 ubiquitin ligase complex. Mediates the ubiquitination and degradation of BCL2, an antiapoptotic protein, thereby playing a role in apoptosis by controlling the stability of BCL2. Targets also the receptor for advanced glycation end products RAGE for ubiquitination and subsequent lysosomal degradation. Directly controls HGAL/GCSAM ubiquitination and degradation and thereby decreases BCR signaling</data>
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">UniProt:Q7TQF2</data>
