    <node id="protein:P00915">
      <data key="d0">PROTEIN</data>
      <data key="d1">Carbonic anhydrase 1</data>
      <data key="d2">Catalyzes the reversible hydration of carbon dioxide (PubMed:10550681, PubMed:16506782, PubMed:16686544, PubMed:16807956, PubMed:17127057, PubMed:17314045, PubMed:17407288, PubMed:18618712, PubMed:19186056, PubMed:19206230). Can hydrate cyanamide to urea (PubMed:10550681)</data>
