    <node id="protein:P33734">
      <data key="d0">PROTEIN</data>
      <data key="d1">Imidazole glycerol phosphate synthase hisHF</data>
      <data key="d2">IGPS catalyzes the conversion of PRFAR and glutamine to IGP, AICAR and glutamate. The glutaminase domain produces the ammonia necessary for the cyclase domain to produce IGP and AICAR from PRFAR. The ammonia is channeled to the active site of the cyclase domain</data>
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
      <data key="d4">UniProt:P33734</data>
