    </node>
    <node id="protein:P60595">
      <data key="d0">PROTEIN</data>
      <data key="d1">Imidazole glycerol phosphate synthase subunit HisH</data>
      <data key="d2">IGPS catalyzes the conversion of PRFAR and glutamine to IGP, AICAR and glutamate. The HisH subunit catalyzes the hydrolysis of glutamine to glutamate and ammonia as part of the synthesis of IGP and AICAR. The resulting ammonia molecule is channeled to the active site of HisF</data>
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
