    <node id="protein:P00811">
      <data key="d0">PROTEIN</data>
      <data key="d1">Beta-lactamase</data>
      <data key="d2">Class C beta-lactamase which confers resistance to penicillins and cephalosporins (PubMed:12323371, PubMed:17956081, PubMed:23043117, PubMed:33199391, PubMed:6998377). Has benzylpenicillin- and cephaloridine-hydrolyzing activity (PubMed:3264154, PubMed:3264155, PubMed:6998377). Has weak cefuroxime, cefotaxime, cefoxitin and oxacillin-hydrolyzing activities (PubMed:19913034, PubMed:3264154, PubMed:3264155)</data>
