    </node>
    <node id="protein:A3FEW8">
      <data key="d0">PROTEIN</data>
      <data key="d1">Beta-galactosidase</data>
      <data key="d2">This beta-galactosidase is also able to catalyze glycosyl transfer to a series of acceptors, including hexose, pentose, beta- or alpha-disaccharides, hexahydroxy alcohol, cyclitol, and aromatic glycosides, resulting in the production of galacto-oligosaccharides (GOS)</data>
      <data key="d3">1.0</data>
