    <node id="protein:P33437">
      <data key="d0">PROTEIN</data>
      <data key="d1">Collagenase</data>
      <data key="d2">Has collagenase activity. Active on soluble collagen, reconstituted type I collagen, heat denatured type I collagen and azocoll, but not gelatin or the synthetic bacterial collagenase substrate PZ-PLGPA. May play a role in virulence</data>
