    <node id="protein:P39900">
      <data key="d0">PROTEIN</data>
      <data key="d1">Macrophage metalloelastase</data>
      <data key="d2">May be involved in tissue injury and remodeling. Has significant elastolytic activity. Can accept large and small amino acids at the P1' site, but has a preference for leucine. Aromatic or hydrophobic residues are preferred at the P1 site, with small hydrophobic residues (preferably alanine) occupying P3</data>
