    <node id="protein:P00747">
      <data key="d0">PROTEIN</data>
      <data key="d1">Plasminogen</data>
      <data key="d2">(Microbial infection) Interacts with dengue virus type 2 particles (PubMed:31726374). Enhances dengue virus type 2 infection in Aedes aegypti mosquito midgut by increasing midgut internalization, resulting in higher infection rates and viral dissemination in mosquitoes (PubMed:31726374)</data>
